  <running_head>EPIGRAMMATA.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="5" para="true">CL. V. PETRO PITHEO, qui</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1" caput="5">versus quondam suos ægrisomnia</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="1" caput="5">vocarat.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">AEGrisomnia quæ vocat suarum</l>
    <l n="5">Hostis Pitheus elegantiarum</l>
    <l n="6">Nunquam dixero somniationes,</l>
    <l n="7">Verum dixero cogitationes</l>
    <l n="8">Bellas, perlepidas, perelegantes:</l>
    <l n="9">Quales nempe suis bona ministrant</l>
    <l n="10">Vanis &amp; Vigilantibus Camoenis.</l>
    <l n="11">Quibus nec Vetus ille somniator</l>
    <l n="12">Iscræus sua comparare possit,</l>
    <l n="13">Sacro somnia somniata monte:</l>
    <l n="14">Et quales sibi cogitationes,</l>
    <l n="15">Quisquis mente sapit, velit venire</l>
    <l n="16">In mentem vigili atque somnianti.</l>
    <l n="17">Non hæc Pitheus ergo somniavit,</l>
    <l n="18">Quæ quum credidit esse somniata,</l>
    <l n="19">Fuit Pitheus ipse somniator.</l>
    <l n="20">Quod si se negat ipse somniasse,</l>
    <l n="21">Sithac somnia quando somniavit,</l>
    <l n="22">Quanto est certius evidentiusque,</l>
    <l n="23">Nunquam talia somniasse quenquam,</l>
    <l n="24">Tanto est certior ipse somniator:</l>
    <l n="25">Ut qui somnia somniata credat, Quæ sunt somnia somn-</l>
    <l n="26">iata nunquam. O felix Vigilánsque somniánsque,</l>
  </main_text>
</page>
